@page "/"

<style>
    /* Full-bleed background using wwwroot/images/spa.jpg with a dark overlay for legibility */
    .info-bg {
        position: relative;
        background-image: url('/images/spa.jpg');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        background-attachment: fixed;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 4rem 1rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: start;
    }

    /* Dark translucent overlay sits on top of the image but behind the text */
    .info-bg::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52); /* adjust opacity for more/less contrast */
        z-index: 1;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Container sits above the overlay (no visible square) */
    .info-container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 28px;
        line-height: 2.2; /* Increased from 1.8 for more vertical spacing */
        color: #ffffff;
        background: transparent;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px; /* Added letter spacing for better readability */
        text-align: center; /* Center all text */
    }

    /* Slightly enlarge body text for readability */
    .section-paragraph {
        font-size: 1.2rem; /* Increased from 1.125rem */
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem; /* Increased from 1.4rem for more space between paragraphs */
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
        line-height: 2.4; /* Extra spacing for paragraph text */
        word-spacing: 2px; /* Added word spacing */
        text-align: center; /* Center paragraph text */
    }

    /* Headings: clean white with subtle text shadow to improve legibility on busy areas */
    h1, h2, h3 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        color: #fff;
        text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto; /* Increased bottom margin from 0.6rem and centered */
        letter-spacing: 1px; /* Added letter spacing to headings */
        text-align: center; /* Center all headings */
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.8rem; /* Slightly increased from 2.6rem */
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem; /* Increased from 1rem */
        letter-spacing: 1.5px; /* Increased letter spacing */
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2rem; /* Increased from 1.9rem */
        margin-top: 3.5rem; /* Increased from 2rem for more section spacing */
        margin-bottom: 2rem; /* Increased bottom margin */
    }

    h3 {
        font-size: 1.35rem; /* Increased from 1.25rem */
        margin-top: 2rem; /* Increased from 1.2rem */
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem; /* Added bottom margin */
    }

    .staff-list {
        text-align: center; /* Center staff list */
    }

    .staff-list ul {
        list-style-type: none;
        padding-left: 0;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem; /* Added margin between staff sections */
        text-align: center; /* Center list */
    }

    .staff-list li {
        padding: 12px 0; /* Increased from 6px for more spacing between items */
        font-size: 1.1rem; /* Increased from 1rem */
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
        line-height: 2; /* Added line height for list items */
        letter-spacing: 0.4px; /* Added letter spacing */
        text-align: center; /* Center list items */
    }

    /* Business Hours and Certifications lists */
    .info-container > ul {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        padding-left: 0; /* Removed left padding for centering */
        line-height: 2.2; /* Increased spacing between list items */
        list-style-position: inside; /* Move bullets inside for better centering */
        text-align: center; /* Center lists */
    }

    .info-container > ul li {
        padding: 10px 0; /* Added padding to list items */
        font-size: 1.1rem; /* Increased font size */
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
        letter-spacing: 0.4px; /* Added letter spacing */
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem; /* Added margin between items */
        text-align: center; /* Center list items */
        list-style-type: none; /* Remove bullets for cleaner centered look */
    }

    /* Strong tags spacing */
    .info-container strong {
        letter-spacing: 0.6px; /* Added letter spacing for bold text */
    }

   

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        h3 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        .info-container {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .staff-list li,
        .info-container > ul li {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }
    }
</style>

<div class="info-bg">
    <div class="info-container">
        <h1>About Fargo Spa and Wellness</h1>

        <p class="section-paragraph">
            Founded in 2016, Fargo Spa and Wellness is dedicated to providing a refined, rejuvenating, and holistic wellness experience. Our team specializes in therapeutic massage, relaxation treatments, and personalized wellness services designed to nurture both body and mind. Located in the heart of South Fargo, ND, our spa is committed to offering a calm, luxurious environment where guests feel supported, valued, and truly revitalized.
        </p>
     
        <h2>Meet the Team</h2>

        <div class="staff-list">
            <h3>Spa Owner</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Olivia Thompson</strong> – Founder & Lead Wellness Coordinator</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Spa Administrator</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Marcus Allen</strong> – Administrative & Client Services Manager</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Spa Staff</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Sophia Martinez</strong> – Massage Therapist</li>
                <li><strong>Daniel Brooks</strong> – Hot Stone & Sports Massage Specialist</li>
                <li><strong>Emily Larson</strong> – Thai Massage Therapist</li>
                <li><strong>Harper Nguyen</strong> – Wellness & Relaxation Specialist</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>Business Hours</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Monday – Friday:</strong> 9:00 AM – 7:00 PM</li>
            <li><strong>Saturday:</strong> 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM</li>
            <li><strong>Sunday:</strong> Closed</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Certifications & Licenses</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Licensed Massage Therapy (LMT)</strong> – All staff certified in professional therapeutic practices</li>
            <li><strong>Certified Thai Massage Practitioner</strong> – Specialized training in traditional Thai techniques</li>
            <li><strong>Hot Stone Therapy Certification</strong> – Safety-focused hot stone treatment training</li>
            <li><strong>Wellness & Aroma Therapy Certification</strong> – Holistic and essential oil integration practices</li>
            <li><strong>Sanitation & Safety Excellence Certification</strong> – Industry-standard cleanliness training</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>




